{"version":1,"content":"<p>英國王儲伉儷威廉和凱特於10月31日萬聖夜，在社交媒體Instagram分享幼子路易小王子1歲舊照賀萬聖節，照片由凱特親自拍攝。</p><p>路易小王子現已8歲。</p><p>據悉這是二人首次公開發放萬聖節帖文，亦是英國王室首次。</p><p>（綜合）</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:46.187503+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":108,"images":0,"source":"明報 消閒","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T14:05:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T03:58:19.124386+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:41:26.771725+00:00","content_hash":"dcc2c68111ea5b1e95a8886ac48e4707f70e350ff210660de98adbd7268a001c","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}